  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Add the **pearl barley (check ingredients list for amount)** to a large saucepan of lightly salted water and bring to the boil. Crumble in the **vegetable stock** cube and cook, stirring occasionally, for **25-30 minutes**, or until soft in texture but slightly chewy. **TIP:** Add more boiling water if the saucepan runs dry. Drain and return to the saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-0-0-04c75833.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pearl barley is cooking, finely slice the **leek**. Finely slice the **button mushrooms**. Finely slice the **zucchini**. Peel and crush the **garlic**. Pick the **thyme** leaves. **TIP:** Pinch the top of the stalk with one hand and run your fingers down the stalk from top to bottom. The thyme leaves will break off where they meet the stem. This technique also works for rosemary! Pick the **parsley** leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-1-0-b8f233fb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the **last 10 minutes** of pearl barley cooking time, heat the **butter** and a **dash** of **olive oil** (to stop the butter burning) in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the **leek**, **mushrooms** and **zucchini** and cook for **7-8 minutes**, or until softened and lightly golden. Add the **garlic** and **thyme** and cook for a further **1-2 minutes**, or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-2-0-5f1ad6fd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the **pearl barley** to the frying pan with the veggies and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-3-0-c9575681.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble in the **fetta** and stir through until melted and creamy. Season to taste with a **pinch** of **salt** and **pepper**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-4-0-8f1e8675.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the leek and mushroom pearl barley between bowls and sprinkle over the parsley. In a medium bowl, add the **mixed salad leaves** and **drizzle** with **2 tsp** of **olive oil** and the **balsamic vinegar**. Serve the salad on the side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/599a684b043c3c3c883bf732-5-0-0a9f5434.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
